00:00:47.040 --> 00:00:49.640
Alright! For my first appointment... {missed a . }

00:00:49.640 --> 00:00:53.790
I nominate Sora-chan to be the Christmas party designer!

00:00:53.790 --> 00:00:54.530
Huh?

00:00:54.530 --> 00:00:58.600
You'll be designing everything at the Christmas party.

00:00:58.600 --> 00:00:59.620
I see.

00:01:00.450 --> 00:01:03.960
