00:06:09.430 --> 00:06:14.430
A party with both schools airing on TV, with fans strewn here and there. {what's with this fan pronunciation}{you only just noticed?}

00:06:15.180 --> 00:06:19.130
A combined party with DreAca will be sure to create a splash. {poor Splash...}

