00:12:11.710 --> 00:12:13.710
Thank you very much!

00:12:13.710 --> 00:12:16.090
Onee-chan. A big cake, they say!

00:12:16.090 --> 00:12:19.670
Yeah. This year's Christmas is going to be crazy. {I almost back translated that as odayaka ja nai}

