00:14:26.630 --> 00:14:29.820
A handmade super-sized Christmas cake.

00:14:29.820 --> 00:14:30.820
I like it!

00:14:30.820 --> 00:14:32.010
I really like it!

00:14:32.010 --> 00:14:34.870
I'm really good at cake making!

00:14:34.870 --> 00:14:35.740
Me too!

