00:17:02.830 --> 00:17:03.720
What do we do?

00:17:03.720 --> 00:17:05.330
We don't have any time.

00:17:06.630 --> 00:17:09.130
We all made this Christmas cake together.

00:17:09.710 --> 00:17:15.200
Everyone here helped design today's Aikatsu Christmas Party.

00:17:15.200 --> 00:17:18.350
I will absolutely not give up.

00:17:18.350 --> 00:17:20.870
I haven't given up either.

00:17:20.870 --> 00:17:22.690
Ichigo-chan, um...

00:17:22.690 --> 00:17:23.970
Of course!

00:17:23.970 --> 00:17:25.670
I had the same idea!

00:17:26.970 --> 00:17:29.510
I get the feeling this'll be something special.

00:17:29.510 --> 00:17:32.530
This is turning out to be an unforgettable Christmas.

00:21:30.010 --> 00:21:32.190
Thanks for waiting!

00:21:32.190 --> 00:21:38.330
Here's the super-sized Christmas cake we put our hearts into making!

00:21:39.760 --> 00:21:46.000
Now, we will apply our super-sized cake's final decoration.

00:21:48.300 --> 00:21:52.910
The cake will be complete when Ichigo-chan lands in the hole in the cake.

00:21:52.910 --> 00:21:55.910
Ai... katsu!

00:21:58.400 --> 00:22:01.630
Our Christmas cake is complete! {I know Ichigo is 100% pure and all, but isn't this a little unsanitary?}

00:22:02.920 --> 00:22:04.050
Perfect!

00:22:04.050 --> 00:22:05.800
So bright.

00:22:07.010 --> 00:22:08.930
That was awesome, Onee-chan!

00:22:08.930 --> 00:22:11.260
This something is way too special.

00:22:12.280 --> 00:22:13.650
Everyone!

00:22:13.650 --> 00:22:15.930
Merry Christmas!

00:22:15.930 --> 00:22:18.950
Merry Christmas!

00:23:55.780 --> 00:23:57.830
This week's Aikatsu Aphorism!

00:23:58.850 --> 00:24:01.290
Ichigo-chan, that was a beautiful jump.

00:24:01.290 --> 00:24:02.260
Thank you!

00:24:02.260 --> 00:24:04.160
The cake was really yummy!

00:24:04.160 --> 00:24:06.720
Thanks to everyone, the party went well!

00:24:06.720 --> 00:24:07.470
Yeah!

00:24:08.210 --> 00:24:09.920
Parties rock!

00:24:10.740 --> 00:24:11.800
New Year's Eve means...

00:24:11.800 --> 00:24:14.300
...the Red-White Aikatsu Battle!

00:24:14.300 --> 00:24:16.300
If Seira-chan's red, I'm white!

00:24:16.300 --> 00:24:18.180
It's on, Hoshimiya Ichigo!

00:24:18.570 --> 00:24:19.890
Next time on Aikatsu!

00:24:19.890 --> 00:24:21.850
Red-White Aikatsu Battle!

00:24:21.850 --> 00:24:25.400
Always passionate, idol activities!
